    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adjūrātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				swearing to</i> something by something, <i>swearing</i>, <i>adjuration</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adjuratione suae salutis,</span>”
				<i>by swearing by her own safety</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 123 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">divini nominis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 2, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
